\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Two-way ANOVA on each judge's system means. Because restyling preserves quality by construction, the style and interaction components are pure bias and the quality component is the only valid signal. \textbf  {Takeaway:} at the coarse quality gaps of the original grid, valid signal dominates for every judge---which is why ranking looks solved there, and why the interesting question is what happens as the gap shrinks.}}{15}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:decomp}{{6}{15}{Two-way ANOVA on each judge's system means. Because restyling preserves quality by construction, the style and interaction components are pure bias and the quality component is the only valid signal. \textbf {Takeaway:} at the coarse quality gaps of the original grid, valid signal dominates for every judge---which is why ranking looks solved there, and why the interesting question is what happens as the gap shrinks}{figure.6}{}}
